      "id": 1,
      "text": "Pines Lake’s streets honor Native American tribes, with names like Osceola Road, Iroquois Trail, and Mohawk Trail.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        2,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
